# 🛍️ ShopEase - Modern E-Commerce Website

A responsive front-end e-commerce website built using **HTML5, CSS3, and Vanilla JavaScript (ES6 Modules)**. ShopEase demonstrates modern web development practices including reusable components, API integration, responsive layouts, dark mode, form validation, and accessibility.

---

# 📖 Project Overview

ShopEase is a fully responsive shopping website that fetches products dynamically from the **Fake Store API** and displays them in a modern UI. The project includes reusable components, a responsive navigation bar, dynamic product rendering, testimonial carousel, dark/light theme toggle, and a validated contact form.

This project was built to practice:

- Semantic HTML5
- Responsive CSS
- JavaScript ES6 Modules
- API Fetching
- DOM Manipulation
- Local Storage
- Form Validation
- Accessibility

---

# ✨ Features

## 🏠 Home Page

- Responsive Hero Section
- Featured Products
- Random products displayed on every page refresh
- Auto-sliding testimonial carousel
- Dark / Light Theme Toggle
- Responsive Navigation Bar
- Mobile Hamburger Menu

---

## 🛒 Products Page

- Products fetched from FakeStore API
- Search Products
- Filter by Category
- Responsive Product Grid
- Loading Indicator
- Dynamic Product Cards

---

## 📞 Contact Page

- Contact Form
- Name Validation
- Email Validation
- Query Validation
- Newsletter Subscription
- Success Message after Submission

---

## 🎨 Common Features

- Responsive Layout
- Sticky Navigation Bar
- Dark Mode
- Theme stored using LocalStorage
- Reusable Components
- Semantic HTML5
- Accessible Forms
- Keyboard Friendly Navigation

