# ♿ Accessibility Considerations

This project follows accessibility best practices:

- Semantic HTML5 elements
- Proper heading hierarchy
- ARIA labels
- Accessible navigation
- Keyboard navigation support
- Form labels
- Image alt attributes
- Visible focus indicators
- High color contrast
- Responsive typography

---

# ⚡ Performance Optimizations

- Products loaded asynchronously using Fetch API
- Reusable JavaScript modules
- Minimal DOM manipulation
- Optimized CSS
- Responsive images
- Theme persistence using LocalStorage
- Component-based structure
- Efficient layouts with Flexbox and CSS Grid

---

# ⚠️ Known Limitations

- No backend integration
- Contact form does not send emails
- No product details page
- No shopping cart functionality
- No user authentication
- Product images depend on FakeStore API

